      "questName": "Q4NexList Leak",
      "questDescription": "NexaCore has hired you to investigate a suspicious log entry referencing a file named \"Q4NexList.\" Use the in-game browser and search engine mini-game to determine whether that image is accessible outside the company, collect evidence, and identify the scope of the exposure. Your findings will lead to a choice about how to handle the exposed client data.",
